{
  "summary": "This experiment tested switching aggregation from avgpool to transformer in a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving slightly higher validation accuracy (0.653) and F1 (0.628) compared to the avgpool baseline (config_003). The marginal improvement suggests transformer aggregation may offer incremental benefits, but the small difference and lack of direct comparison to other modalities leave uncertainty about its significance or generalizability to multimodal settings."
}

